<!-- Deepening variant: countdown from ten. -->
<voice speaker='female' speed='0.85'>
    <tone preset='binaural_delta' frequency='120' volume='0.3'/>
    I'll count down from ten to one, and with every number you double your depth.
    <pause duration='0.8'/>
    <overlay>
      <part>
          <speed value='0.8'>
              Ten
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              nine
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              drifting down
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              eight
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              seven
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              so soft, so heavy
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              six
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              five
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              half way there
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              four
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              three
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              letting everything go
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              two
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
              one
              <pause duration='0.8'/>
          </speed>
      </part>
      <part volume='0.2' looped='true'>
          <random>
            <part>Down</part>
            <part>Sink</part>
            <part>Lower</part>
            <part>Drop</part>
            <part>Fall</part>
            <part>Heavier</part>
            <part>Slower</part>
            <part>Sink deeper</part>
            <part>Let go</part>
            <part>Relax</part>
            <part>Release</part>
            <part>Further</part>
          </random>
      </part>
    </overlay>
    <pause duration='1'/>
    At one, you let go completely.
    <pause duration='0.5'/>
    Sissy Drops.
    <pause duration='1.2'/>
    <effect type='reverb' preset='cathedral'>
        <scramble>
            <part>Deep asleep.<pause duration='1'/></part>
            <part>Deep in trance.<pause duration='1'/></part>
            <part>Perfectly open to my voice.<pause duration='1'/></part>
            <part>Completely relaxed.<pause duration='1'/></part>
        </scramble>
    </effect>
    <random>
        <part>Now, you are completely relaxed and open to my voice.</part>
        <part>Your mind is completely open to my voice, and ready to receive new information.</part>
        <part>You are now in the perfect state to receive new information.</part>
    </random>
    <pause duration='0.8'/>
    You are doing perfectly. Deeper still, with every word I speak.
</voice>
